{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51287","headline":"菩萨蛮 · 李白","name":"菩萨蛮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举头忽见衡阳雁，千声万字情何限。\n叵耐薄情夫，一行书也无。\n泣归香阁恨，和泪淹红粉。\n待雁却回时，也无书寄伊。\n（《尊前集》）（《全宋词》第四册第二五一月页云《历代诗余》卷九载此爲陈以庄词，杨金本《草堂诗余》卷下作陈达叟词。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}